  sigmoid loss for evaluation or inference as in the following example:

  ```python
  if mode == "train":
    loss = tf.nn.nce_loss(
        weights=weights,
        biases=biases,
        labels=labels,
        inputs=inputs,
        ...)
  elif mode == "eval":
    logits = tf.matmul(inputs, tf.transpose(weights))
    logits = tf.nn.bias_add(logits, biases)
    labels_one_hot = tf.one_hot(labels, n_classes)
